\pard\ulnone\b0\par
\f1 The Mage suite of tools provide access to DMS files and metadata.\line\line\b Mage Extractor\b0\line\line Mage Extractor can extract MS/MS search results from SEQUEST, X!Tandem, \line Inspect, or MSGF+ analysis jobs and combine the results into a single \line tab-delimited text file or a single SQLite database. MAGE Extractor is \line the successor to STARSuite Extractor; it includes support for MSGF results.\par
\f2\fs22\par
\b\f1\fs16 Mage File Processor\line\b0\line Mage File Processor can be used to copy files from a series of \line analysis job or dataset folders to your local computer.  The program\line can either copy each file individually, or it can combine a series of\line files into a single file.  \par
